OL,3,ABlake Lively awarded $400,000 of $8m
OL,4,Ashe claimed for legal fees in Baldoni
OL,5,Abattle
OL,6,
OL,7,FActress Blake Lively has been awarded
OL,8,F$400,000 (#340,000) of the $8m (#6.9m)
OL,9,Fshe tried to claim from her former
OL,10,Fco-star Justin Baldoni to cover her
OL,11,Flegal fees and costs to fight a
OL,12,Fdefamation case he brought.
OL,14,FLively initially sued Baldoni, her
OL,15,Fco-star and director of the 2024 film
OL,16,FIt Ends With Us for sexual harassment
OL,17,Fand retaliation, before he countersued
OL,18,Ffor defamation.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
