OL,3,ABlake Lively awarded $400,000 of $8m
OL,4,Ashe claimed for legal fees in Baldoni
OL,5,Abattle
OL,6,
OL,7,FA judge dismissed his defamation
OL,8,Fcomplaint in 2025, and she argued she
OL,9,Fwas entitled to $7.5m (#6.4m) to cover
OL,10,Fher lawyers' fees and $540,000
OL,11,F(#460,000) for other costs.
OL,13,FBut the judge said she should receive
OL,14,Fconsiderably less - a total of $407,451
OL,15,F- because she requested money for more
OL,16,Fpeople and time than were necessary to
OL,17,Fdefend the defamation claim.
